<!--
    The Android 12+ launch screen icon, animated the way Auxio's is.

    A placeholder of the note is on screen from the first frame. The gradient note is under a
    placeholder-coloured border that is drawn along its outline and kept inside it. The border
    starts wide enough to hide the whole note and thins to nothing. That shows the note inset by
    the same distance everywhere, filling out evenly until it matches the outline. The starting
    width is the smallest that hides the note, so colour appears as soon as the animation starts.

    The border has to be opaque to hide the note, so the placeholder is an opaque colour rather
    than Auxio's translucent grey.
-->
